1	/**
2	 * JSX Syntax Smoke Tests
3	 * 
4	 * This test file imports all page components to catch JSX syntax errors early.
5	 * If any component has JSX syntax errors, the test will fail during the import phase.
6	 * This acts as an early warning system for broken JSX before deployment.
7	 */
